The software in this directory ("ee/") is source-available but is not open
source. It provides ProductMaxxing team features: the cloud lease service client,
review caps and auto-pause, admin policy, license checks and content-free ledger
sync.

You may read, copy and modify this software for evaluation and to contribute
changes back. You may use it in production only with a valid ProductMaxxing
subscription for the number of seats in your license, or during an evaluation
period of up to 60 days.

From version 0.29.0, you may also use in production, without a subscription,
the parts of this software that run on your own machines and use no paid hosted
service: the brain, review caps and auto-pause, and the application of your
organization's admin policy. A subscription is still required for the parts that
use ProductMaxxing's paid hosted services, such as cloud leases.

